cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: 'voltcrypt: encrypted volumetric imaging with attestation-gated key release'
abstract: Streaming AES-256-GCM encryption of imaging volumes, with a client that
  releases the decryption key only after the server proves, by signed measurement
  over its own code, which program will read the study.
type: software
authors:
