  family-names: Barret
  affiliation: CPE Lyon, Lyon, France; Department of Orthodontics, Adams School of
    Dentistry, University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill, NC, USA
repository-code: https://github.com/Raphael-Barret/volume_crypto
keywords:
- reproducible research
- research software
- medical imaging
- confidential computing
- remote attestation
license: MIT
